stateDiagram-v2
    state "S0 Greeting, consent" as S0
    state "S1 Eligibility" as S1
    state "Quote-Only" as QO
    state "S2 Needs, suitability" as S2
    state "S3 Recommendation" as S3
    state "Hand-off (S4 intake)" as HO
    state "Human Escalation" as HE
    state "Exit" as EX
    state "Exit (Advisory)" as XA
    state "Data Erasure" as DE
    state "Pause" as PA
    [*] --> S0
    S0 --> HE: existing_policy
    S0 --> EX: consent refused
    S0 --> QO: consent + specific_plan
    S0 --> S1: consent + new_purchase
    S1 --> DE: under 18 (V2)
    S1 --> HE: NRI, age band, complex proposer
    S1 --> HE: unanswerable after one re-ask
    S1 --> EX: not eligible
    S1 --> QO: eligible + express_path
    S1 --> S2: eligible
    QO --> EX: satisfied with quote
    QO --> S2: opts into advisory
    QO --> S1: opts into advisory, not yet screened
    S2 --> HE: red affordability, vulnerable + complex, out of scope (V5)
    S2 --> XA: over-insurance
    S2 --> S3: sufficiency met or elected + suitability current
    S3 --> HE: no eligible option
    S3 --> EX: declines after re-discovery
    S3 --> PA: needs time
    S3 --> S2: all plans rejected
    S3 --> HE: rejected after the loop limit
    S3 --> HO: plan chosen + valid quote + disclosures acknowledged (V7)
    PA --> S3: resume
    note right of QO : No path to the hand-off (C13)
